2. Made it so a warning appears if you enter hydrant test data and the static pressure is equal to the residual pressure.\par
\par
3. Fixed a problem with tree and grid creation.  If you indicate that you want to delete existing pipes before creating a tree or grid, all of the existing pipes will now be deleted.\par
\par
4. Made it so you can use the arrow keys to navigate in the Enter/Edit Node Data window.\par
\par
Version 6.0.232 7/10/09\par
1. Fixed a metric conversion problem.  When a project's units were changed from English to metric, the values on the General Project Data window were not converted.\par
\par
2. Fixed a problem that made the K-Factor Calculators unusable when the program units were metric.\par
\par
Version 6.0.231 6/18/09\par
1. Fixed an error on the Overall Pipe Output Data report.  The displayed pressure loss or gain was the same for all constant pressure loss devices and pumps.\par
