Version 6.0.229 6/8/09\par
1. Made it so the user can choose whether or not the pump curve will be shown on the hydraulic graph.  This choice will affect the calculated demand pressure as well.\par
\par
2. Corrected the pipe system water volume.  This result was sometimes wrong for projects with autosized pipes.\par
